Package: limen
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Ostap Mykhaylyak <me@ostap.dev>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: nginx | nginx-core | nginx-light | nginx-full | nginx-extras
Recommends: logrotate
Section: httpd
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/ostap-mykhaylyak/limen
Description: nginx manager with a web panel and a command line
 limen owns the nginx configuration of a machine and renders it from a
 model of plain YAML files: proxy hosts, redirects, TCP/UDP streams,
 access lists and certificates, issued and renewed through ACME. Every
 change is tested with nginx -t before nginx is reloaded, and kept in a
 history it can be rolled back from.
 .
 The package prepares the layout and saves the current nginx
 configuration, but does not start limen: starting it takes nginx over.
